on-arrival: {! SW.roadEventDone(Q); if ((Q.outer_seceded || 0) > 0.02) Q.outer_seceded = Math.max(0, Q.outer_seceded - 0.05); else Q.outer_sep = Math.max(0, Q.outer_sep - 4); Q.rim_relation += 4; !}

= A Governor Changes Sides

The governor of a dozen worlds in the Outer Rim, who took them into the Confederacy two years ago, sends word through the Caucus's Rim delegates: he would rather be heard on Coruscant than ruled from Raxus. His worlds' flags go back up over their capitols within the month.
